        <item>
            <title>1.1.5</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 11:08:37 -0400</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>17</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.5</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>1.1.5</h3>
<ul>
<li>The "Playing" row only appears for sound you can actually hear — muted autoplay videos no longer count.</li>
<li>Picture in picture only pops out a video you're watching with sound. Muted videos, previews and short clips stay put.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
